msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D4A207D5_34C3_4503_8EFC_84D4E1870A11"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dining hall...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Al refettorio...?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_8F2B740D_2847_41C8_BB0A_628B80A27314
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eddb47300dd802af8a1c56ec657d35ba0298fcb7c6cf4e897b11b047773d8d3d
#. default-sha256: bee4ec9565a6b20b0578ab38daf78aceec7d5f32763406d52993ec4f42035412
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8F2B740D_2847_41C8_BB0A_628B80A27314"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There’s quite the crowd—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫all the people here helping with festival prep—"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫so you should probably hurry if you want to get some."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫C’è un bel po’ di gente—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫tutte persone che ci stanno aiutando con i "
"preparativi per la festa—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫quindi dovresti sbrigarti se vuoi mangiare qualcosa."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BEF42CD6_E478_4B9C_840F_05222C5DCC16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c272e309e051549318edb4bc758850c1c9b88343e292974f2d1fb015352c215
#. default-sha256: 5bff915d97118ea6d450fb83e74f628a101ed4cd0e228898eb01281f9620b752
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BEF42CD6_E478_4B9C_840F_05222C5DCC16"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(My mind’s still waking up...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(La mia mente si sta ancora svegliando...)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C7E8CD0E_A37C_4F74_9BA4_F882B2547D9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 645fa978678f9cd62973f3362201ff2228052ee4288bf8f0558a896ba0003cd6
#. default-sha256: b47c1c11f9f646270c4c077eb90737010e0bb0be75c8bc748fa61dfa20f837aa
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C7E8CD0E_A37C_4F74_9BA4_F882B2547D9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As I mentioned yesterday, the heart of the harvest festival is here at the church, "
"but it’s a city-wide event."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Come ho detto ieri, il cuore della festa è qui alla chiesa, ma è un evento "
"cittadino."

#: scenario8:scenario8_53575B42_7B18_4E16_8B25_177FB4D8788D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f65ef0ea8ad84271e8ad087b43995a01dfd83f8498ad91480027128d5440bb3
#. default-sha256: 6323ea4029c6a7fa6e465349f2b2bf7356827cd60c9395ee41f92575c63795fe
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_53575B42_7B18_4E16_8B25_177FB4D8788D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The courtyard?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Il giardino?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B64CB175_0E23_4863_BC09_19D1FF388D0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82499c32de5c67ead1ae03ab608806f6ce5941f83622af80ec0130b47bd3837e
#. default-sha256: 98f4e75747e6cc0ad8ba2561995e6d45cb9e52042fc1f94c98bede12a98d1463
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B64CB175_0E23_4863_BC09_19D1FF388D0C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but the other two are bound to find out if either of us do anything too conspicuous."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ma se uno tra noi faccesse qualcosa di troppo sospetto, gli altri due verrebbero a saperlo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_682B4051_76FA_4FCA_8928_FBB0B107C8EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6d6dffa18463d191cdd6c5192f845cb4eb5898f87971b61103b77338a2992c5
#. default-sha256: ed4cb2c142b7f4ad9aad1db45033c53c3cad3fca5794f07c54e928886746b1a4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_682B4051_76FA_4FCA_8928_FBB0B107C8EC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫That would be the smart thing to do."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫È⟪k:5⟫ la cosa più intelligente da fare."

#: scenario8:scenario8_76EA564A_ACAC_47A1_9660_169AE6940A2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d622693b8ce02600d2a1d28606043b6f2ecbec16f606dd72dc27f158a20b0cf7
#. default-sha256: 3e70b568ebb9f72704befecddce3015aeb613be7dc986cc01397ff0d69623090
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_76EA564A_ACAC_47A1_9660_169AE6940A2F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Mell. Do you know where I could find the nun?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Mell. Sai dove posso trovare la suora?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_8C48AD16_D741_4098_8BC8_3C515E421164
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9819429d4af3d55e5f37be7dca4f2799404bbbf372239cc6091c5cae9cd2453
#. default-sha256: 9c67185ca5bb1a18c11df51484c56defdc65d8d7763e8e05964ddabb667fccd7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8C48AD16_D741_4098_8BC8_3C515E421164"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Her? She should be in the dining hall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La suora? Dovrebbe essere al refettorio."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E42A706C_CB27_470E_95C7_5E3E5CDA825D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d98ee1cb8cb72888a78eae611fd26ecb2c53fd9f303f2d916a1770b0e78b464
#. default-sha256: 58c6f4c73986d8707ae35923eaadb78fe59c05cd8de0415a580ba1af52f38a2e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E42A706C_CB27_470E_95C7_5E3E5CDA825D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That’s when we go up into the tower.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫...Though even if they were on the "
"property,⟪k:5⟫you wouldn’t be able to just walk up and talk to them.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Especially not the "
"lord."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Perché è allora che saliamo in cima alla torre.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫...Ma anche se fossero "
"nei paraggi, non riusciresti ad avvicinarti per parlare con loro come se niente fosse.⟪k:5⟫ "
"Specialmente al lord."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8F0BBBC3_47A2_476E_8486_AB7488405E97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 433971482395e4ca0798b0556158fa3ce481ef112a5bac4702eeae5f9965bf6f
#. default-sha256: 945180e3959f168349e0ff52c7376f9d80000787c7fc22293b3916a3e403afc7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8F0BBBC3_47A2_476E_8486_AB7488405E97"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Also, I don’t keep track of where they go or what they do, sorry...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I, ⟪k:4⟫"
"well... ⟪k:5⟫I don’t really ⟪k:6⟫want⟪k:7⟫ to know what they’re up to..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Inoltre, non tengo d’occhio dove vanno o cosa fanno, mi dispiace...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Io, ⟪k:4⟫"
"ecco... ⟪k:5⟫non ci tengo particolarmente a sapere cosa stiano combinando..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_27B9C282_B9A4_4780_803F_602A4C63B24D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ba3f013a94419c4ca309e9b650f6b929964fa13225d71dfefe08ca48206d263
#. default-sha256: 30fa003b018dd0d56865400a42a88ea1d5efeffc89c32e88165d1e7a4ac4e760
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_27B9C282_B9A4_4780_803F_602A4C63B24D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That first step is still a big one, though, at least for him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quel primo passo è ancora troppo grande,⟪k:3⟫almeno per lui."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1D6B76B2_FE19_4B42_89FA_6CA963539A69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65eb031087a2f30a7e7e0ea18b670365ad4e295a6cedaa3058dd1120fbd026ed
#. default-sha256: e0ce6ad7e8110969dc032f32aab1ba3018e4cfc6f32dde2b96410de0cd37172a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1D6B76B2_FE19_4B42_89FA_6CA963539A69"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I suppose."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Lo credo anch’io."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8449313A_BEBB_4E43_AB30_486BF6FF69DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d6227d25550cefa75acd96d9a9f1409209d2b7dbf93871acaada6e3033eac9d
#. default-sha256: c765617467690e27fa71592930b20cf5823e841c00b49579c4abe984c648530d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8449313A_BEBB_4E43_AB30_486BF6FF69DA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But I’m used to it, so don’t worry about me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ma ci sono abituata, non preoccuparti per me!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D5820516_97A8_4C88_8685_55DF6643BC0B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4aa5d26ae2dcb1e1ffed9401bcc8cee2cdb173dd6d434f55f22f211480df791
#. default-sha256: 3a1731ff97b75027430677b8da928173d856286ee87ac44eacd8c7d461d2c23f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D5820516_97A8_4C88_8685_55DF6643BC0B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Which means, when my eyes are closed, she has no light at all...)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Il che significa... ⟪k:2⟫che quando chiudo gli occhi,⟪k:3⟫lei non riceve alcuna "
"luce...)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F7488AA8_4EDB_4346_A046_3EBA43BC2A41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7bddb804c2ad8bdf7cf2cd03a94e29e780ebac31c4d6c8c20cfbb61bdced8f46
#. default-sha256: 9c417761f8f51aea3ebebee250c010b820fd284ca22b3f11814982a12112b0af
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F7488AA8_4EDB_4346_A046_3EBA43BC2A41"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You won’t have the energy to do anything if you don’t keep yourself well rested "
"and nourished."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non avrai energie per fare nulla se non riposi e non ti nutri a dovere."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2F3F51A3_D154_4F08_8CAB_04A82112DF8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7d5ee4afa76ee6b9b28922a69815144b808d1573e95825eac854e0e71ce2e54
#. default-sha256: f6914458dae4f925acf89ed786d281b9e52caff48d2d333025ccbba1f6769f62
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2F3F51A3_D154_4F08_8CAB_04A82112DF8F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Sitting in the center of the room is a long table, lined with bread and wine."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Al centro della stanza vi è un lungo tavolo, su cui sono disposti pane e vino."

#: scenario8:scenario8_781D2988_007B_4129_8E5B_D73C73D5793B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 428f27e1d5da81301ac498c8dbcfbff6650f7485fd10a7b4c6fe079ee83a761b
#. default-sha256: 79794e7df463d9c361c4a38e4495e84cd0b30c8b41c6ce3a1481acd21ef35498
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_781D2988_007B_4129_8E5B_D73C73D5793B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The majority of people in the room look poor, like they genuinely need the assistance, but "
"there are a handful of those who look more than well off."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La maggior parte delle persone riunite nella stanza sembra povera, come se avesse sincero "
"bisogno di assistenza, ma ci sono alcuni tra loro che sembrano stare più che bene."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5FBA3FAD_9898_4571_B9AF_DEA3F9A071C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc62882ff0781297d11bb25106ecb802e6ab444d344c1e3bd1f745fa7ced66f8
#. default-sha256: 13e8a51bd31af4c089b8959758491ec78126bc586410b1889963e2213e935ef2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5FBA3FAD_9898_4571_B9AF_DEA3F9A071C1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They don’t seem to be for want of supplies at the moment, though. ⟪k:3⟫I assume "
"that’s thanks to the lord’s patronage."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Però non sembra che siano a corto di provviste,⟪k:3⟫ora come ora. ⟪k:4⟫Immagino "
"sia grazie al sostegno⟪k:5⟫del lord."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4BC57774_1CF9_46D4_B960_2378768987EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e78313c81d1a605efcec122847feeec263d9799a65de431318357fdff7f81fe
#. default-sha256: dd99519c355c9225f77fe2c07d0fbdf20dd9c72965ace7fee93f610fad4f8df7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4BC57774_1CF9_46D4_B960_2378768987EC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Give it a rest already, young man!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Can’tcha see, she ain’t interested!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dacci un taglio, giovane!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non vedi che non le interessa?!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F1FD8954_1505_450D_BACF_2D4A20E4BF61
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 793fcf7c4616c6fe1ff4aebca9bcd509ca8f2b316e564181a47d10921d5ea7e0
#. default-sha256: d4309c009ed38fefff2aba802bd06bc98aff585d39034163ec962b0c990c67d8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F1FD8954_1505_450D_BACF_2D4A20E4BF61"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Wha— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ah, ⟪k:4⟫wait—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Che cosa— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ehi, ⟪k:4⟫aspettate—!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_124CB209_1F0B_48D0_B8FD_8276777E2E89
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 058ec8fa1ae333a419e54c3e80c475987c729cbcad6b5a5d1c0315b7f5e46b58
#. default-sha256: 41a1250545e4187dcfc488dff9c05ca330b373d7abcf0ed82d9d111170f7cb89
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_124CB209_1F0B_48D0_B8FD_8276777E2E89"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Of course, our Saintess!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Pick it up, young man!⟪k:5⟫Ya need some time "
"outside ta cool off!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Certamente, Sua Santità!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Avanti, ragazzo!⟪k:5⟫Vatti a rinfrescare un po’ "
"le idee!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6ADE54BF_F95E_4EE3_97AA_AB543F997F27
